    {
      "text": "In a large saucepan, combine sour cream, half-and-half and Worcestershire sauce. Stir over low heat until smooth and just warm. Add onions, parsley, salt, garlic powder and pepper. Stir in noodles. Serve topped with Parmesan cheese.",
